---
// NewsletterSignup.astro
// Footer-mounted email capture, Kit form ID: 9452008 (UID b7d6fe4c1e)
---

<section class="newsletter-cta bg-stone-800 text-stone-100 py-6 px-4 rounded-md mb-6">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-4">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-1">Free: Outdoor Sauna Buying Checklist</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-300">A verification-first checklist for the site, foundation, heater, permits, freight, warranty, and full project budget.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:w-1/2">
      <form action="https://app.kit.com/forms/9452008/subscriptions" method="post" data-sv-form="9452008" data-uid="b7d6fe4c1e" data-format="inline" data-version="5" data-form-location="footer" class="kit-form flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
        <input type="email" name="email_address" placeholder="your@email.com" required class="kit-email-input flex-1 px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-stone-600 bg-stone-900 text-stone-100 placeholder-stone-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-600" />
        <button type="submit" class="kit-submit-btn bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap">Send me the checklist</button>
      </form>
      <p class="kit-fine-print text-xs text-stone-400 mt-2">Checklist plus occasional buyer guidance. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
